    <item>
      <title>Massagem</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projetos/massagem/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projetos/massagem/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;img-full&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;img-container&#34; style=&#34;--w: 1920; --h: 1080;&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3.jpg#full&#34;&gt;&#xA;              &lt;picture&gt;&#xA;                &lt;source srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3_hu_e2c1c09b07954a3a.webp&#34; type=&#34;image/webp&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3_hu_caf4ed946e0e75e8.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1920&#34; height=&#34;1080&#34;&gt;&#xA;              &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massagem&lt;/strong&gt;, 2024&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Videoperformance&lt;br&gt;&#xA;12’5” (loop)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Concepção: Tiago Gasperin&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Massoterapeuta: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.instagram.com/rafaelamartine.z/&#34;&gt;Rafaela Martinez&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Captação e pós-produção: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.instagram.com/leocaobelli/&#34;&gt;Leo Caobelli&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Assistente de produção: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.instagram.com/sammyduart.e/&#34;&gt;Sammy Duarte&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedimento:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Contratar uma massoterapeuta para massagear as escadarias do Museu de Arte do Rio Grande do Sul (MARGS).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;img-container&#34; style=&#34;--w: 1920; --h: 1080;&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;              &lt;picture&gt;&#xA;                &lt;source srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3_hu_e2c1c09b07954a3a.webp&#34; type=&#34;image/webp&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/massagem3_hu_caf4ed946e0e75e8.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1920&#34; height=&#34;1080&#34;&gt;&#xA;              &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;O vídeo, exposto em loop, foi comissionado para a exposição de reabertura do MARGS, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.margs.rs.gov.br/midia/post-scriptum-um-museu-como-memoria/&#34;&gt;Post scriptum — Um museu como memória&lt;/a&gt;, após o Museu ficar mais de 6 meses fechado devido às enchentes de maio de 2024 em Porto Alegre.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
